Package: polished
Title: Streamlined Downloader and Preprocessor for WHO POLIS Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Mohamed A.",
           family = "Yusuf",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mohamedayusuf87@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9339-4613"))
Description: One-function interface to the WHO POLIS OData API. Works
    around POLIS's non-standard pagination (Id-range walks instead of
    OData '$skip'), year-aligned date filters, and per-endpoint
    quirks. Supports incremental updates with per-batch checkpointing,
    parallel year-fetching via a PSOCK cluster, and post-download
    completeness verification.
